  "description": "Erection of a side infill extension to both properties at 38 and 40 Duke Road, in addition, a replacement rear extension to 38 Duke Road with new roof-lights. \n",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended by Section 51 of the Planning and Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: [Design and Access Statement, P020, P022, P021, P010, P011, P012, P013, Fire Statement, Unnumbered Location Plan, P120, P121, P122, P113, P112, P111, P110 and 002. Received. 18/03/2026; Flood Risk Assessment. 23/03/2026].\r\n\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building, unless otherwise shown on the approved plans.\r\nReason: In order to safeguard the appearance of the area.",
    "Condition : 4 - The hereby approved works to 38 and 40 Duke Road, Chiswick, W4 2DD shall be carried out at the same time in their entirety to both properties and shall not be part built.\r\nReason: The proposed extensions would not be considered acceptable if not carried out in their entirety and to protect the living conditions of the residents of both properties.\r\n"
  ],
